# Cloudflare

This app runs on Cloudflare Workers through OpenNext, with D1 and R2. Before designing or editing that code, read the matching skill in https://github.com/cloudflare/skills at commit `0871daceb347e3c51693fbe9c77555468df7e410`. Do not vendor those skills. Details and the deploy ban are in `AGENTS.md`.

- `skills/wrangler` for Wrangler config and commands. Use the Wrangler version in `package.json`.
- `skills/workers-best-practices` for runtime, bindings, secrets, and logs.
- `skills/durable-objects` only when adding Durable Objects. None exist in this repo.
- `skills/web-perf` for loading and interaction performance.
- `skills/nextjs-on-cloudflare` for Next.js on Workers. This repo uses OpenNext (`@opennextjs/cloudflare`), not vinext.

Do not deploy, log in, or set secrets.
